---
// Curo in motion: one patient conversation on the left, the work Curo does
// with the hospital, the insurer and the doctor appearing on the right.
// Without JS everything is shown at once.
---

<div class="chat" data-chat>
  <div class="chat-phone">
    <div class="chat-head">
      <span class="av">C<b>.</b></span>
      <div>
        <b>Curo</b>
        <small>online</small>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chat-body">
      <div class="msg in" data-at="0">Oi! O Dr. Rocha pediu exames antes da cirurgia. Como eu faço?</div>
      <div class="typing" data-at="1" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      <div class="msg out" data-at="5">
        Pronto, Marina. Seu pré-operatório ficou para quinta, 14/11, às 8h. A guia do convênio já foi enviada e o Dr. Rocha
        recebeu o resumo. Te lembro na véspera.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ul class="chat-behind" aria-label="What Curo did behind the scenes">
    <li data-at="2">
      <span class="mono">Hospital</span>
      <b>Pre-op booked</b>
      <small>Thu 14/11 · 8am</small>
    </li>
    <li data-at="3">
      <span class="mono">Insurer</span>
      <b>Authorization sent</b>
      <small>protocol issued</small>
    </li>
    <li data-at="4">
      <span class="mono">Dr. Rocha</span>
      <b>Case summary</b>
      <small>on his WhatsApp</small>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <span class="chat-note mono">Illustrative conversation</span>
</div>
